	"message.beyondtheabyss.solomon": "???",
	"message.beyondtheabyss.solomon0": "So, you have arrived. I knew you would come.",
	"message.beyondtheabyss.solomon1": "The strength to fell that great dragon... To witness it firsthand is more astonishing still. What you have accomplished was not the mere slaying of a single beast.",
	"message.beyondtheabyss.solomon2": "The Ender Dragon you vanquished was a mighty being who ruled the dimension known as 'The End'. However... there exist others of its ilk, and some far more sinister, that have seized other realms to forge their own kingdoms.",
	"message.beyondtheabyss.solomon3": "For an age, I have watched them, seeking a way to thwart their ambitions, but time has not been my ally. Yet, you are different. You can be the very torch to ignite a new era.",
